# Lyra's ruling: an Angel dealt lethal damage at the same time as you gain life is not saved by her counter. Bot1's Youthful Valkyrie
# (2/4 after Lyra enters) and Healer's Hawk attack; Bot2's Astelli Reclaimer (5/4 flying) blocks the Valkyrie, dealing it lethal damage
# while the Hawk's lifelink damage gains Bot1 1 life. State-based actions kill the Valkyrie (CR 704.5g) before Lyra's trigger
# is on the stack, so it resolves with Lyra, who is not damaged, the only Angel left: she gets the counter (4/4).

